<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!-- Hardened-runtime exceptions for Developer ID builds (scripts/release.sh): none needed today.
         No App Sandbox: Likely reads other apps' accessibility trees, captures windows and launches
         agent CLIs. Accessibility and Screen Recording are TCC grants and need no entitlement. Likely
         sends no Apple Events, so there's no automation entitlement (and agents are denied them). -->
</dict>
</plist>
